      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_dcc02d1934080e4ea36f366d5aaf84fa855bffbdec724b42f0851dda62f23512"
      ],
      "text": "The codebase is organized as a React UI (src/), a Tauri 2 shell (src-tauri/), provider-agnostic core types (sinew-core), the agent loop and tools (sinew-app), and per-provider adapter crates."
    },
